# The registry of every device Coolify reaches through this tunnel: one line per device, with a
# comment above it naming the device and its project. Each device's line is printed by its setup:
#   restrict,port-forwarding,permitlisten="0.0.0.0:<port>" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... <hostname>-tunnel
# Ports start at 22001; take the next free one. Commit, push, redeploy.
